SUMMARY:Excelencia Awards & NextGen Benefit
DESCRIPTION:Excelencia Awards & NextGen Benefit \nJoin NAHJ on November 17\, 2026\, for an evening celebrating excellence in journalism and supporting the next generation of Latino storytellers. \nThis annual event honors leaders across journalism\, communications and education who are advancing press freedom\, uplifting diverse voices and investing in the future of the field. \nProceeds support NAHJ scholarships\, internships\, mentorship and training programs that help build more representative and impactful newsrooms. \nYou can fin more information here: https://nahj.org/excelencia/ \nTickets can be purchased here: https://givebutter.com/Excelencia26 \nFor sponsorship opportunities\, please visit: https://nahj.org/excelencia/sponsors/
URL:https://nahj.org/event/25925/
LOCATION:583 Park Ave\, 583 Park Avenue\, New York\, NY\, 10065\, United States
CATEGORIES:Awards,Next Generation
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nahj.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/EA26_SaveTheDate-11-Thumbnail.png
